#
# LeakSanitizer suppressions for ci/leak-check.sh.
#
# Each entry names a function of GLib or EDS, never a function of this
# project. Give the reason for each entry.

# EDS 3.52 computes this directory name once, without a lock. Two threads
# that call it at the same time both allocate the name, and one copy leaks.
# The backend tests construct ESourceServerSide objects in parallel threads.
leak:e_server_side_source_get_user_dir
